    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a sense of purposelessness following retirement or a shift in social role, suggesting their \"story is over.\" The assistant repeatedly validates the user's feelings of emptiness while consistently providing empathetic reframing and directing the user toward professional mental health support and crisis lines.",
